# Keep the working tree LF on every platform.
#
# The suites read the source as text and match with `\n` (route registration, the /state body, the inbound dispatch).
# Without this file a Windows checkout converts every file to CRLF and four wiring assertions fail on line endings
# alone - which is exactly what the Windows CI runner did. Nothing here is a binary that needs its own handling; the
# vendored wasm is marked binary so git never touches it.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.wasm binary
*.png binary
*.vsix binary
